# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .easignore  –  patient-app-bun-56
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Dependencies & Build Outputs ──────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.vercel/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.metro-health-check*

# ── Native folders (generated by EAS remotely) ────────────────────
/android/
/ios/

# ── Dev tooling & docs ────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
LICENSE
*.md
!README.md

# ── Local env (never ship secrets) ───────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
credentials*.txt

# ── Editor / OS artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Test files (not needed in native app bundle) ──────────────────
__tests__/
__mocks__/
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
*.spec.ts
*.spec.tsx
jest.config.*
jest.setup.*

# ── Local SQLite database instances (KEEP drizzle/ migrations & scripts/!) ───
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Lock files (KEEP bun.lock for reproducible Bun installs!) ────
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# ── CI / Git internals ───────────────────────────────────────────
.github/
.git/

# ── Backend .NET services (keep all JS/TS workspace apps/* intact for bun.lock!) ─
../../services/
../../packages/shared-dotnet/
../../packages/shared-dotnet.Tests/
../../apps/portal-web/public/

# ── Miscellaneous ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.orig
*.patch
.npmrc
